ficeClawLandingFeaturePreMeetingTitle:"Pre-meeting prep",officeClawLandingFeaturePreMeetingDesc:"Automatically pulls history before meetings and generates a pre-meeting brief in one tap, so you walk in fully prepared",officeClawLandingFeaturePostMeetingTitle:"Post-meeting collaboration",officeClawLandingFeaturePostMeetingDesc:"One-tap sync of meeting minutes to Feishu/DingTalk/WeCom and into your enterprise OA for collaboration.",officeClawLandingFeatureTaskTitle:"Task management",officeClawLandingFeatureTaskDesc:"Real-time sync of notes across devices, one-tap to-dos, efficient collaboration anytime, anywhere",officeClawLandingFeatureSkillMarketTitle:"Skill market",officeClawLandingFeatureSkillMarketDesc:"Rich office skill extensions for PDF, Word, Excel, PPT and more — install on demand",officeClawLandingFeatureBenefitTitle:"Bonus benefits",officeClawLandingFeatureBenefitDesc:"Buy an Office Notebook Air series or recorder card to get 1–3 months of free access, ready to use out of the box",officeClawLandingFeatureBenefitHighlight:"Limited-time offer",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingTitle:"Pre-meeting prep",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingSubtitle:"Smart history retrieval, one-tap briefing",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingDesc:"Before a meeting, OfficeClaw automatically pulls related history, project progress and attendee backgrounds to generate a structured pre-meeting brief, so you enter every meeting fully prepared.",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingHighlight1:"Auto-links past meeting minutes and to-dos",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingHighlight2:"Generates a pre-meeting briefing doc in one tap",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingHighlight3:"Books meetings and generates meeting links automatically",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingUser1:"I have a product review at 3 PM — help me prepare, and also create a Tencent Meeting link for me.",officeClawLandingScenarioPreMeetingAi1:"Your pre-meeting brief is ready:\n\n📋 Topic: Q2 product iteration review\n👥 Attendees: 6 from product, 4 from R&D\n\n📌 To-dos from the last meeting:\n• User research progress 85%\n• Prototype design delivered\n• Technical plan pending confirmation\n\nMeeting link generated",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesTitle:"Post-meeting collaboration",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesSubtitle:"Auto-extracts commitments into clear to-dos",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesDesc:"During or after a meeting, OfficeClaw automatically identifies key decisions, commitments and to-do tasks, generates structured minutes and syncs them to all attendees.",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesHighlight1:"Auto-extracts commitments and owners",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesHighlight2:"Smartly separates decisions from discussion points",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesHighlight3:"One-tap sync of minutes to Feishu/DingTalk/WeCom",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesUser1:"Summarize the minutes from the meeting we just had and send them to my Feishu work group",officeClawLandingScenarioMeetingNotesAi1:"Meeting minutes generated:\n\n✅ Key decisions:\n• Confirmed 3 core features for Q2 launch\n• User growth target adjusted to 20%\n\n📝 To-dos:\n• @Zhang San: complete the technical plan review (by Friday)\n• @Li Si: deliver the user research report (by next Wednesday)\n\n📎 Synced to the Feishu group",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingTitle:"Task tracking",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingSubtitle:"Cross-device tracking with proactive overdue alerts",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingDesc:"Once a task is created, OfficeClaw tracks its progress across devices, reminds you before deadlines and proactively alerts on overdue items, so every item reaches closure.",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingHighlight1:"Real-time sync of notes and to-dos across devices",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingHighlight2:"Smart reminders before deadlines, proactive alerts when overdue",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingHighlight3:"Auto-escalation when a project is repeatedly delayed",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingAi1:'⚠️ Task reminder\n\n📌 You have 3 to-dos due soon:\n\n1. Technical plan review — due tomorrow\n2. Customer proposal draft — due the day after\n3. Weekly report — due this Friday\n\n🔴 Overdue alert: "Supplier coordination" is 2 days late — suggested to follow up today.',officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingUser1:"Move the technical plan review to next Monday for me",officeClawLandingScenarioTaskTrackingAi2:'✅ The deadline for "Technical plan review" has been updated to next Monday, and related collaborators have been notified.',officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerTitle:"Customer management",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerSubtitle:"Smart relationship upkeep, never miss an opportunity",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerDesc:"OfficeClaw proactively manages your customer relationships, reminds you about customers you haven't contacted in a while, and records interaction history so every touchpoint feels personal.",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerHighlight1:"Proactive reminders for customers not contacted in 15 days",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerHighlight2:"Auto-records interaction history and key information",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerHighlight3:"Smart identification of opportunity milestones with follow-up suggestions",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerAi1:"🔔 Customer follow-up reminder\n\nThe following customers haven't been contacted for over 15 days:\n\n• Mr. Zhang (XX Tech) — last contact: Mar 15\n  Last topic: contract renewal, suggested follow-up this week\n\n• Ms. Li (YY Group) — last contact: Mar 10\n  Last topic: product demo feedback pending confirmation\n\n💡 Suggestion: Mr. Zhang's contract expires in early April — consider arranging a call today.",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerUser1:"Send Mr. Zhang a message to schedule a call tomorrow afternoon",officeClawLandingScenarioCustomerAi2:"✅ Draft message:\n\n\"Hello Mr. Zhang, since our last talk we've put together a renewal plan and would like to arrange a call with you tomorrow at 3 PM. Would that work?\"\n\nI'll send it via Feishu once you confirm.",officeClawLandingAdvantageProactiveTitle:"Passive response vs proactive intelligence",officeClawLandingAdvantageProactiveOld:"Waiting for your commands, missing key milestones",officeClawLandingAdvantageProactiveNew:"Auto-checks to-dos after meetings, customer follow-up reminders, project delay alerts",officeClawLandingAdvantageHubTitle:"Point tools vs an all-platform hub",officeClawLandingAdvantageHubOld:"Data scattered across platforms, hard to consolidate",officeClawLandingAdvantageHubNew:"Connects WeChat/Feishu/DingTalk/WeCom/QQ into one conversation entry",officeClawLandingAdvantageSyncTitle:"Manual sync vs automatic sync",officeClawLandingAdvantageSyncOld:"Manually sending minutes to OA for collaboration, time-consuming and tedious",officeClawLandingAdvantageSyncNew:"One sentence after a meeting sends everything to your enterprise OA for deep collaboration",officeClawLandingTrustTechLabel:"AISPEECH AI technology foundation",officeClawLandingTrustTechDesc:"15 years of speech and NLP expertise",officeClawLandingTrustSecurityLabel:"Enterprise-grade security & compliance",officeClawLandingTrustSecurityDesc:"Encrypted data transmission, privacy protection certified",officeClawLandingTrustSupportLabel:"Dedicated service support",officeClawLandingTrustSupportDesc:"7×24 technical response guarantee",openClawPermissionNotice:"The Claw plugin can read, export, and write your data. Keep your token secure and ensure the entire setup is performed by you. Please read ",serviceUseNoticeWrapped:"Service Notice",openClawInstallUsage:"Usage: Copy the installation command and token and send them in the Agent conversation",tokenManagementTip:"Token management: revoke and regenerate if the token is compromised",invalidate:"Revoke",get:"Get",getSuccess:"Success",getTokenFailed:"Failed to retrieve token",skillUsageGuideLabel:"Skill guide:",skillUsageGuideWra